{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/04c4d75afd0953eda3ee584d8282dd78.avif?t=1774718606\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future dominated by ruthless AI legions, the remnants of humanity hide deep within the underground city known as the\u00a0<strong>Underworld</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are\u00a0<strong>Iron Shadow</strong>\u00a0\u2014 the lone machine that chose to stand with humanity. Against the endless waves of enemies, your only mission is simple yet absolute:\u00a0<strong>survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another survival game.\u00a0<i>Iron Shadow: Survival Protocol</i>\u00a0blends the tense progression of the survivor genre with the mobility and precision of a platformer. Every run demands agility, quick decisions, and relentless combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hybrid Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics fused with platformer action. Auto-attacks are just the beginning \u2014 dash, roll, and leap across the battlefield to outmaneuver relentless AI swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/1105c18d741829307cb7cdf1d2060700.poster.avif?t=1774718606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/1105c18d741829307cb7cdf1d2060700.webm?t=1774718606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrade &amp; Meta Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect weapons during battle, upgrade them, and unlock new levels of power. Combine augments and skills to create unique builds and fresh strategies every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/39415238de981e7ed4fca8885db79925.poster.avif?t=1774718606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/39415238de981e7ed4fca8885db79925.webm?t=1774718606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dystopian Sci-Fi World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where AI legions dominate the surface and humanity hides below. Experience a hardboiled narrative of a lone machine fighting for mankind, brought to life with silhouette visuals and a stark sci-fi art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/a607beeb0034a0489b9eaa7c223e1d6b.avif?t=1774718606\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy never stops coming. Waves grow stronger with time. The question is not whether you can win \u2014 it\u2019s\u00a0<strong>how long you can endure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/12193089e6f31f46571da2704633256e.poster.avif?t=1774718606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/12193089e6f31f46571da2704633256e.webm?t=1774718606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048930?t=1774718606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/80288b47d79f557eb2c9f3e0cedc6638ffba6256/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774718606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/0ea2fde17f6d8f7f5c9e12f1069389aacaa6845a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774718606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/0ea2fde17f6d8f7f5c9e12f1069389aacaa6845a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774718606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048930/extras/04c4d75afd0953eda3ee584d8282dd78.avif?t=1774718606\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future dominated by ruthless AI legions, the remnants of humanity hide deep within the underground city known as the\u00a0<strong>Underworld</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are\u00a0<strong>Iron Shadow</strong>\u00a0\u2014 the lone machine that chose to stand with humanity. Against the endless waves of enemies, your only mission is simple yet absolute:\u00a0<strong>survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another survival game.\u00a0<i>Iron Shadow: Survival Protocol</i>\u00a0blends the tense progression of the survivor genre with the mobility and precision of a platformer. Every run demands